# Frontend Next.js Rules

- Use TypeScript for application code.
- Keep components focused and reusable only when reuse is real.
- Use existing design primitives before adding new UI libraries.
- Handle loading, empty, error, and success states.
- Keep client/server boundaries explicit.
- Align frontend API assumptions with `docs/API_CONTRACT.md`.
